{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1062","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. Fun with Integers"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a positive integer $$$n$$$ greater or equal to $$$2$$$. For every pair of integers $$$a$$$ and $$$b$$$ ($$$2 \\le |a|, |b| \\le n$$$), you can transform $$$a$$$ into $$$b$$$ if and only if there exists an integer $$$x$$$ such that $$$1 \\lt |x|$$$ and ($$$a \\cdot x = b$$$ or $$$b \\cdot x = a$$$), where $$$|x|$$$ denotes the absolute value of $$$x$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After such a transformation, your score increases by $$$|x|$$$ points and you are "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"not allowed"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" to transform $$$a$$$ into $$$b$$$ nor $$$b$$$ into $$$a$$$ anymore."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Initially, you have a score of $$$0$$$. You can start at any integer and transform it as many times as you like. What is the maximum score you can achieve?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A single line contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$2 \\le n \\le 100\\,000$$$) — the given integer described above."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print an only integer — the maximum score that can be achieved with the transformations. If it is not possible to perform even a single transformation for all possible starting integers, print $$$0$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"8"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"6\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"28"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"0"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example, the transformations are $$$2 \\rightarrow 4 \\rightarrow (-2) \\rightarrow (-4) \\rightarrow 2$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third example, it is impossible to perform even a single transformation."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"1062D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1062/problem/D"}